{"ID":"20240118145016-49pozjg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145016-49pozjg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145016-49pozjg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145016-uavjfjs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161559-t8nwjpi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:135,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161558-ekq24bi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:117,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:117\u0026#125;","title":"317楝实（金铃子楝子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204144012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145016-uavjfjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145016-uavjfjs","updated":"20240122161530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，有小毒。治温疾，伤寒，大热，烦狂，杀三虫，疥，疡，利小便水道。生山谷。今名金铃子。又名川楝子、苦楝子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161533-yvp90ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161533-yvp90ro"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产四川云贵等地。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161535-cmpyq66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161535-cmpyq66"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】金铃子味苦，性微寒，其皮味苦，性微寒，有小毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161536-rlv0jxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161536-rlv0jxi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为解热，利尿，镇痛要药[1.金铃子、延胡索并用功同吗啡。一般3钱，重用5、6钱不等。2.治胰脏癌，肝癌痛。]，治妇女白带，疝气及心腹诸痛症。苦楝皮杀虫治疥癣，亦可为蔬菜杀虫药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161539-jev0w8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161539-jev0w8c"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】苦楝皮治疣虫，利大小肠。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161541-gtrmjgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161541-gtrmjgj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】入心及小肠，止上下腹痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161542-aa6ab7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161542-aa6ab7v"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【括要】泻膀胱，治诸疝虫痔，能入肝舒筋，导小肠，膀胱之热，为疝气要药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161543-wefkkd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161543-wefkkd9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161545-us3nz99","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161545-us3nz99"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】胃虚寒者禁之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161530-hg1x8i9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161530-hg1x8i9"}},{"ID":"20240122161546-tm12xpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161546-tm12xpb"}},{"ID":"20240122161546-n8nh2fm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161546-n8nh2fm","updated":"20240122161551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看，317，楝实，这个药呢，我们一般在市场上叫金铃子的就是这个东西，我使用得很多，这个是《神农本草经》来的。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161555-q986b0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161555-q986b0q","updated":"20240204144002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看性味，金铃子味苦，性微寒，它的皮微苦，性微寒，这是我们使用金铃子的这个，果实类，它是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"解热利尿镇痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般来说，我用金铃子的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"最多肝癌、胰脏癌的痛，金铃子呢，是止痛的要药，我常常配合延胡索一起使用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那西医呢，就用吗啡，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中药的止痛药用金铃子、元胡索来止痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，效果……，你开重点，如果说，一般来我都开3钱，3钱下去，病人还痛的话，你可以加到5钱都没关系。元胡索、金铃子两个一起并用。那这个专门治疗……，金铃子，平常你使用的时候，妇女的白带、疝气，有人得到疝气，金铃子呢，可以治虫、皮肤的疥廯。那你种生菜，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金铃子煮水，你种菜时候不要洒农药，洒金铃子上去，虫子不来的。很好用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161558-ekq24bi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161558-ekq24bi","updated":"20240204144012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看金铃子这个皮呢，可以治疗蚘虫，利大小肠，那你看那个【括要】，它能够治各种的疝气，能够泻膀胱，能够入肝腧经，肝经入到睾丸呐，都可以使用。有问题都可以使用，这个金铃子是疝气的要药。睾丸肿大或怎么样，都可以使用，金铃子。这个我们用得很多。效果相当好。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161559-t8nwjpi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161559-t8nwjpi"}}]}